1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,520 --> 00:01:59,980
Another Soul Transformation ?

25
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:01,400
Junior Ceng Niu,

26
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:04,260
as I told you,

27
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,800
today

28
00:02:06,150 --> 00:02:08,060
is the day you die.

29
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:30,060
My spiritual energy is in chaos

30
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:31,500
and my Origin Soul is damaged.

31
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:33,600
Even when using the celestial sword

32
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:36,330
I am not as strong as when I fought Red Butterfly.

33
00:02:37,950 --> 00:02:41,020
This Heaven-Sealing Formation is extremely complex,

34
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:43,200
it must be some kind of ancient inheritance.

35
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:45,100
I can't escape it in a short time.

36
00:02:51,220 --> 00:02:52,300
Master, run !

37
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:13,100
This truly is a fine sword.

38
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:16,060
It even contains a Sword Spirit !

39
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,650
Good.

40
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,300
This sword can be yours

41
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:26,900
but the flag that can summon tribulations

42
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:28,770
belongs to me.

43
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,300
Fine,

44
00:03:31,620 --> 00:03:34,500
but I am taking back the star compass

45
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:36,430
that belonged to my clan.

46
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:37,660
Of course.

47
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,460
Giant Demon Clan ?

48
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:50,900
Giant Demon Clan Ancestor
Early stage Soul Transformation

49
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:50,610
This old man is indeed from the Giant Demon Clan.

50
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:52,500
Back in the Celestial Realm,

51
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:56,260
you stole the star compass from our young master, Chi Hu.

52
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,460
But today

53
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:59,060
I will take it back !

54
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:03,990
Two Soul Transformation old monsters joining hands

55
00:04:03,820 --> 00:04:05,960
just to take my life...

56
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,300
It's an honor,

57
00:04:09,850 --> 00:04:12,400
I will be sure to remember it.

58
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:16,000
Indeed,

59
00:04:16,420 --> 00:04:18,860
you should remember it well.

60
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,170
However,

61
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:23,060
you will leave your artifacts behind !

62
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:34,840
That's a good artifact !

63
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:44,230
I'm out of spiritual energy...

64
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:12,360
Wait !

65
00:05:14,980 --> 00:05:15,930
Ancestor,

66
00:05:15,820 --> 00:05:17,400
please let this Junior

67
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,630
kill this person

68
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:20,330
to avenge myself.

69
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,360
Chi Hu...

70
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,360
Ceng Niu,

71
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:31,560
accept your death !

72
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:34,460
Spiritual energy ?

73
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,400
Brother Ceng,

74
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,330
escape to the southeast !

75
00:05:38,820 --> 00:05:39,860
Chi Hu,

76
00:05:39,820 --> 00:05:40,800
what are you doing !?

77
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,660
Go, now !

78
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,430
Ancestor,

79
00:05:47,410 --> 00:05:49,720
the star compass is something I gifted to Ceng Niu,

80
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,760
not something he stole.

81
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:53,200
Ceng Niu saved my life many times in the Celestial Realm.

82
00:05:52,980 --> 00:05:54,860
I, Chi Hu, am a man of my word.

83
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:56,900
How could I abandon him just like that ?

84
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,500
Step aside !

85
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,060
The star compass is useless to our clan.

86
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,020
So what if I give it to Ceng Niu ?

87
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:07,200
You took his flying sword, isn’t that enough ?

88
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:13,000
If you weren’t the junior with the purest Giant Demon blood,

89
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:16,730
I would kill you today, you ungrateful brat !

90
00:06:17,150 --> 00:06:18,560
Once we return,

91
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:21,480
you will be punished to 100 years

92
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:24,100
of constant pain from body refinement !

93
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,800
I, Chi Hu, am an honorable man

94
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:30,060
so I can’t do something so heartless.

95
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,000
Brother Ceng,

96
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,960
I...

97
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:35,770
tried my best...

98
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,600
This formation is mysterious,

99
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,900
it's even able to prevent me from entering

100
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,900
the Heaven Defying Bead.

101
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,650
In the southeast

102
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:45,320
there's a forest

103
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:47,160
rich in Yin energy.

104
00:06:47,850 --> 00:06:48,900
Indeed,

105
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,740
if I can escape the formation there,

106
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,400
I can flee into a spatial rift.

107
00:06:54,150 --> 00:06:55,460
Junior,

108
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:57,360
before a Soul Transformation cultivator,

109
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,800
a mere Soul Formation cultivator

110
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,300
cannot survive.

111
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:02,210
Li Yuanfeng's
Tea Domain

112
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:04,200
A Soul Transformation domain ?

113
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:06,370
This is my Tea Domain.

114
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,360
The fragrance of tea

115
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:12,450
allows me to savor the flavors of Life.

116
00:07:13,550 --> 00:07:15,960
The pot hides a universe

117
00:07:16,650 --> 00:07:19,710
and the leaves represent Spring and Autumn.

118
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:20,450
Life and Death Domain,

119
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:21,030
activate !

120
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:24,960
With tea as my companion

121
00:07:25,950 --> 00:07:29,400
I grasped the meaning of Life.

122
00:07:42,980 --> 00:07:46,630
Before the domain of a Soul Transformation cultivator,

123
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,650
your domain

124
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,330
is pathetic.

125
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,970
We’ve wasted enough time,

126
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:05,660
after killing him

127
00:08:05,420 --> 00:08:07,200
I have other matters to attend to.

128
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:08,830
Fellow cultivator Li,

129
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,170
make your move.

130
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,700
Since you refuse to act,

131
00:08:14,020 --> 00:08:17,060
does that mean you are afraid of Mount Suzaku ?

132
00:08:17,450 --> 00:08:18,630
Forget it,

133
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:21,360
since I initiated this

134
00:08:21,850 --> 00:08:23,860
I’ll take care of it myself.

135
00:08:34,220 --> 00:08:36,030
He's here at last...

136
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:39,060
The Heaven-Sealing Formation ?

137
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:43,300
If I didn’t already know this formation,

138
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:45,460
it would’ve been really hard

139
00:08:45,450 --> 00:08:47,400
for me to enter.

140
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:49,030
The Corpse Sect ?

141
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,770
Although they’re only Early stage Soul Transformation,

142
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:56,300
it’s said that Giant Demons who reach Soul Transformation

143
00:08:56,420 --> 00:08:59,030
awaken their bloodline's power.

144
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:02,570
I'd prefer not to provoke them too much.

145
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:05,260
Ceng Niu,

146
00:09:05,380 --> 00:09:07,030
do you have nothing better to do

147
00:09:07,050 --> 00:09:08,970
than getting yourself into trouble ?

148
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:12,570
You two old fossils,

149
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:17,290
aren't you ashamed of bullying a Soul Formation junior ?

150
00:09:18,150 --> 00:09:20,230
I’m taking this person away.

151
00:09:23,380 --> 00:09:24,250
Fellow cultivator...

152
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:24,960
Scram !

153
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:27,660
A mere Early stage Soul Transformation

154
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:30,060
whose cultivation was forcibly raised

155
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:32,230
is unworthy

156
00:09:31,980 --> 00:09:33,760
of speaking to me !

157
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:34,960
I refuse,

158
00:09:35,250 --> 00:09:37,260
he must die.

159
00:09:37,450 --> 00:09:39,360
And his corpse

160
00:09:39,420 --> 00:09:41,200
belongs to me !

161
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:44,000
You’re not from the Corpse Sect,

162
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,930
what use do you have for a corpse ?

163
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,650
That's because...

164
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,060
When I arrived,

165
00:09:51,050 --> 00:09:53,300
Wang Lin was already dead.

166
00:09:53,650 --> 00:09:57,100
But a strand of his soul fled to the Foreign Battlefield.

167
00:09:57,850 --> 00:09:59,700
I pursued it

168
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:02,000
but after decades of searching,

169
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,460
I gave up.

170
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:05,210
I fear that

171
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:06,860
the Heaven Defying Bead is also...

172
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:09,860
Is anyone else

173
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:12,770
aware of this matter ?

174
00:10:13,550 --> 00:10:14,800
Of course not,

175
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:17,700
I’ve erased all witnesses’ memories.

176
00:10:17,820 --> 00:10:19,610
Only I and the Envoy

177
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:22,360
sent to Zhao's Heaven's Tower

178
00:10:22,180 --> 00:10:23,370
know the truth.

179
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:26,260
Good,

180
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:27,900
very good...

181
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:39,030
A treasure wanted by even the Cultivation Alliance

182
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:41,900
can’t just disappear like that !

183
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:47,460
If we offer the Heaven Defying Bead to the Cultivation Alliance,

184
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:51,630
we will be promoted to a rank 6 cultivation country

185
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:54,230
and gifted our own cultivation planet !

186
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:56,100
When that happens,

187
00:10:56,650 --> 00:10:59,410
my Giant Demon Clan

188
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:03,010
will have the ability to have Ascendant level cultivators.

189
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:13,050
I searched for Wang Lin’s whereabouts for years.

190
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:16,760
Only after Chi Hu returned from the Celestial Realm

191
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:19,030
did I learn by coincidence

192
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:22,360
that Ceng Niu was Wang Lin.

193
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:26,100
To prevent the country of Suzaku from interfering,

194
00:11:25,980 --> 00:11:27,860
I waited for the right moment.

195
00:11:28,450 --> 00:11:30,860
When Li Yuanfeng came to me,

196
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:34,030
I used the star compass as an excuse

197
00:11:33,950 --> 00:11:36,360
to join him to kill Wang Lin.

198
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:39,460
Even if Wang Lin dies,

199
00:11:39,950 --> 00:11:41,900
as long as I have his corpse,

200
00:11:42,220 --> 00:11:46,630
I can get my hand on the Heaven Defying Bead.

201
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,630
I have my own reasons.

202
00:11:57,250 --> 00:11:58,560
Scram !

203
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,260
You dare ?!

204
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,940
Giant Axe

205
00:12:12,150 --> 00:12:15,530
Border of the
country of Pilu

206
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:20,610
Sun Tai came to save me

207
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:23,130
but he doesn't have good intentions.

208
00:12:23,450 --> 00:12:25,830
However, it was the only way to escape the formation.

209
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:28,060
A thousand-year slave seal...

210
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:31,400
It's only been a few years and you caused such a disaster !

211
00:12:31,450 --> 00:12:34,900
This time, I’ll seal you completely

212
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:37,500
so you won’t drag me down with you.

213
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,600
Seal !

214
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:56,260
Do you really think I'm afraid to fight you ?!

215
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:10,200
How ?!

216
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:11,860
My cultivation...

217
00:13:10,250 --> 00:13:13,640
Wang Lin's avatar
3rd layer of Qi Condensation

218
00:13:12,620 --> 00:13:14,200
How did this happen ?

219
00:13:14,680 --> 00:13:16,460
Li Yuanfeng’s Tea Domain

220
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,200
and Sun Tai’s sealing mark

221
00:13:18,450 --> 00:13:21,530
must have combined into a powerful restriction

222
00:13:21,350 --> 00:13:23,800
that's draining my spiritual energy completely.

223
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:26,000
If this goes on,

224
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:29,130
I’ll revert into a powerless mortal.

225
00:13:31,350 --> 00:13:34,140
The last time I was this badly injured

226
00:13:34,050 --> 00:13:36,460
was when Teng Huayuan destroyed my body.

227
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:41,440
Who would have thought that centuries later,

228
00:13:41,620 --> 00:13:43,960
I would encounter such a disaster again.

229
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:46,500
I’ve been cautious every step of the way

230
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:50,410
but still ended up at the mercy of others.

231
00:13:51,450 --> 00:13:52,660
Ceng Niu

232
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,160
is mine !

233
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,540
Explode !

234
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:26,510
When Soul Transformation cultivators fight for real,

235
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,250
it’s a battle of life and death.

236
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,930
Are you ready ?

237
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:36,430
Fighting a Middle stage Soul Transformation is exhausting

238
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:40,170
but Wang Lin is crucial to the Giant Demon Clan.

239
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,230
In that case,

240
00:14:42,750 --> 00:14:44,460
I have no choice.

241
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:48,210
Now that it’s come to this

242
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:50,430
you’ve forced my hand !

243
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,830
Soul Transformation cultivators rarely fight to the death.

244
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:06,400
Once our celestial spiritual energy is depleted,

245
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,630
it cannot be replenished.

246
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,850
But since you insist,

247
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:14,900
this old man will face you

248
00:15:15,050 --> 00:15:17,230
with celestial spiritual energy !

249
00:15:19,450 --> 00:15:21,260
The might of celestial spiritual energy

250
00:15:21,050 --> 00:15:23,410
is exclusive to Soul Transformation and above.

251
00:15:23,450 --> 00:15:26,690
I will never let the chance

252
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:29,850
to revive my clan slip away !

253
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:40,060
This old man is Middle stage Soul Transformation.

254
00:15:40,050 --> 00:15:42,600
Even with your Giant Demon Clan’s bloodline,

255
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:45,030
you cannot bridge the gap between us.

256
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,570
Still refusing to yield ?

257
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:50,760
My Lightning Domain

258
00:15:50,650 --> 00:15:53,540
was gained after I paid a great price

259
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:57,730
to cultivate a century on the Heavenly Thunder Planet !

260
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,410
Sun Tai's
Thunder Domain

261
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:00,210
You mere Early stage Soul Transformation,

262
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,970
will die now !

263
00:16:12,750 --> 00:16:14,810
I’ll take this person away.

264
00:16:14,850 --> 00:16:17,250
and return him in 7 days.

265
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,140
Not possible !

266
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:20,090
If I let you take him,

267
00:16:20,050 --> 00:16:23,230
it's the same as giving you my Origin Soul.

268
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:38,260
You dare to sneak up on him under my nose !?

269
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:42,210
The seal on this kid is only half-complete.

270
00:16:42,750 --> 00:16:46,230
I must finish off these two quickly

271
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:47,770
or else

272
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:50,090
something might go wrong.

273
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:53,060
Since reaching Soul Transformation,

274
00:16:53,580 --> 00:16:57,260
this is my first time using my bloodline's power.

275
00:16:58,180 --> 00:16:59,430
You...

276
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:01,810
take my attack !

277
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:03,530
Turn !

278
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:09,630
Demon Child,

279
00:17:09,450 --> 00:17:10,500
come out !

280
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:16,970
Demon Child
Middle stage Soul Transformation

281
00:17:16,650 --> 00:17:17,830
Turn !

282
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:19,060
Demon Child,

283
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,000
kill him !

284
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:23,360
Turn !

285
00:17:41,890 --> 00:17:44,460
With my Early stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

286
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:47,410
my bloodline's power has no attack power.

287
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:51,130
It can only teleport the target to a distant planet.

288
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:07,170
If I keep fighting,

289
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:10,600
I'm afraid my soul will dissipate...

290
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:33,030
I played all my cards

291
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:36,300
but they didn't amount to anything.

292
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:38,370
It was all in vain...

293
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:41,400
My cultivation is still falling...

294
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:45,250
My spiritual energy is leaving my body...

295
00:18:47,220 --> 00:18:49,430
The path of cultivation

296
00:18:49,760 --> 00:18:51,500
truly is

297
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:53,570
unpredictable.

298
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:55,900
In 8 years,

299
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:59,900
Wan’er will face the law of the heavens again.

300
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,660
8 years...

301
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:31,670
To let go of the consequences of my actions

302
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:33,390
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

303
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:35,330
like scattered ink.

304
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:42,810
As destiny falls

305
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:42,810
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

306
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:50,410
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

307
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:50,410
wither and melt into rivers.

308
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:57,970
Who can deceive

309
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:57,970
the law of the heavens ?

310
00:19:58,040 --> 00:20:01,290
Countless generations

311
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:01,290
have tried before me.

312
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:05,010
But how could I not catch my dreams

313
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:05,010
within my warm fingers ?

314
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:09,090
You're at my side when I'm alone

315
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:12,410
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

316
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:16,370
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

317
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:20,570
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

318
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:20,570
in the streets.

319
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:25,530
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

320
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:25,530
Can I break the rules ?

321
00:20:25,290 --> 00:20:28,250
To run towards you !

322
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:31,570
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

323
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:36,210
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

324
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:39,610
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

325
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:44,290
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

326
00:20:44,490 --> 00:20:49,970
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

327
00:20:49,840 --> 00:20:53,890
If your soul is willing to wander,

328
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:58,530
can I still take your hands

329
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:58,530
and hold them tight ?

330
00:20:58,440 --> 00:21:01,610
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

331
00:21:01,360 --> 00:21:06,490
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

332
00:21:06,250 --> 00:21:09,770
I dream of destroying

333
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:14,490
the shackles of our fate.

334
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:18,450
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

335
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:21,250
You're the hardest to let go of.

336
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:25,130
I want to be with you again

337
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:28,490
so I can look in your eyes.

338
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:33,730
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
